<title>SWEDEN: Swedish consumer prices flat in May.</title>
<headline>Swedish consumer prices flat in May.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish consumer prices were flat in May compared to April, Statistics Sweden said on Thursday.  </p>
<p> SWEDISH CONSUMER PRICES     May 97     April 97   May 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change	    0	 +0.5	  -0.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	     +0.3     +0.2	  +1.0</p>
<p> Index (base 100=1980)	  257.0     257.0	257.3</p>
<p>Note - Economists polled by Reuters had expected consumer prices to rise by 0.1 percent in May.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
